# AGENTS.md — Phoenix Apps

Builds against this app run through the platform's deterministic Elixir orchestration loop (`mix codegen.loop`), which drives the full cycle — developer → gate → reviewer → context-curator → commit — via separate per-role invocations, plus one deterministic commit step at the end (`codegen-commit`, a script, not a role). There is no self-orchestrating agent session for non-interactive builds; the loop is the sole build driver.

